segments.text:
Verſ. 14.
Thus ſaith the Lord; The labour of Egypt, and the merchandiſe of Ethiopia, and of the Sebeans, men of ſtature ſhall come vnto thee, and they ſhall bee thine: they ſhall follow thee, and ſhall goe in chaines: they ſhall fall downe before thee, and make ſupplication vnto thee, ſaying;
Surely God is in thee, and there is none other God beſides.
